lavender-minimal 1100: the USB channel only (WinUSB log, lv:put, lv:shot, lv:key, tap/swipe,
lv:fastboot/reboot/poweroff) on the first lavender kernel - rewritten from 1016/1017 without the
profiler, peek/poke, smp, psci and PON dump; lv:shot reads the splash the frames are copied into.

